# Commit Summary

When the user asks you to commit (stage, commit, commit-and-push, or similar):

- After completing the commit, include the **exact commit message** in your brief summary.
- Format: show the commit hash and the full message, e.g. `a1b2c3d Add hero section for tablet/desktop`.
- If multiple commits are created in one request, list each hash and message.
- Keep the rest of the summary brief; the commit message should be easy to spot.
